From 36219070049845f798ebf9be26c43d50a6cf146b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:56:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Add a crisp glass key sound pack

Short synthesized glass taps (key, space, delete, return) played through a SoundPool,
selectable in the keyboard settings and on by default. The samples are generated by
tools/make_sounds.py.
